## How to Run

### 1. Start Docker containers
```bash
docker run -d -p 9411:9411 --name zipkin openzipkin/zipkin
docker run -d -p 9090:9090 --name prometheus -v C:/Users/vishnu\ vardhan\ reddy/Downloads/OmniCharge/prometheus.yml:/etc/prometheus/prometheus.yml prom/prometheus
docker run -d -p 3000:3000 --name grafana grafana/grafana
```

### 2. Start services in order
1. `discovery-server` (8761)
2. `config-server` (8888)
3. All business services + `logging-service` (8086)

### 3. Access dashboards
| Dashboard | URL |
|-----------|-----|
| Zipkin Tracing | http://localhost:9411 |
| Prometheus Metrics | http://localhost:9090 |
| Grafana Dashboards | http://localhost:3000 (admin/admin) |
| User Service Swagger | http://localhost:8081/swagger-ui.html |
| Logging Service Swagger | http://localhost:8086/swagger-ui.html |
